Instrument for RAR-R32 (D.2 read 6), never merged: RAROG_ABLATE names the RAR-R03
parallel-search members to switch off (order: the pool's root scores in the root
order; center: the window centred on the pool's deeper exact score; rotate: each
helper's rotated root list; jitter: the per-thread offset of the reduction jitter).
Every switch acts only inside a pool; each member's first consultation goes to stderr.
